  "protocol": "Four counterbalanced pairs. Fresh server per run, fixed 8192 MiB managed budget, one slot, context and batch 4096, microbatch 8, BF16 KV, eight threads. Stock default wide prefill, 8/8 warmup, then 912/64 greedy, ignore EOS, seed 42, no prompt cache. QKV and Z remain separate. Both paths run without GPU/engine profilers or speculative decoding. Uncontrolled OS file cache. Client TPS is 63 intervals from first to last token; aggregation pools times across equal-length runs.",
